      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RULESQUE (4) disappointed last time out over the longer journey when jumping the race favourite. His form prior was super, leading at this track and trip and only being caught late. This sets up favourably back to 1300m and he can get back to winning ways. DUST ASIDE (2) is hard to knock on his recent form, finishing 2.7L off the winner over 1100m last time out. He's gone under as the odds-on pop his last couple, but he's running strong figures in defeat and the rise in trip now may be what he's looking for. Can't be discounted.  SOLAR SYSTEM (5) lifted strongly only to just miss last start over 1300m at this track. Ready to go one better. SANCTIONS (8) turned in a decent effort last start to finish third over 1100m at this track. This looks a good race for her and there is no reason she cannot find winning ways. LA SIGNORA DANE (1) won't be far away after a narrow defeat last time out.",
